{"at":"2026-10-02T07:53:40.543Z","source":"artistcommunities-residencies-p13","item":"artistcommunities-residencies-p13|https://artistcommunities.org/directory/open-calls/buinho-residency-program-call-2027-portugal","url":"https://artistcommunities.org/directory/open-calls/buinho-residency-program-call-2027-portugal","field":"apply_fee","evidence":"Fees 2027\nWe do not have public or private funding for the residencies, and aside from the normal house bills and work consumables, we have a full-time person just for production support of the residencies. As such, we have to apply fees, but we do keep the fees to a minimum since we are a not-for-profit association based in a rural area.\nMonthly fees are the following:\n1. São João larger bedroom with private bathroom - 1000€;\n2. São João other two bedrooms - 900€;\n3. Padaria's house - 1000€;\n4. Casa da Avo - 1000€;\n5. Casa Buinho (the whole house for one resident) - 1300€.\nAn accompanying person has a 50% discount but must share the accommodation. It is an additional measure to support couples, artists with children, or possible artistic collaborations.\nThe minimum duration of each residency is two weeks and the maximum is two months.","dropped_value":{"free":false,"amount":1000,"currency":"EUR"},"reason":"evidence-not-substring"}
{"at":"2026-10-02T07:53:40.543Z","source":"artistcommunities-residencies-p13","item":"artistcommunities-residencies-p13|https://artistcommunities.org/directory/open-calls/buinho-residency-program-call-2027-portugal","url":"https://artistcommunities.org/directory/open-calls/buinho-residency-program-call-2027-portugal","field":"participation_fee","evidence":"Fees 2027\nWe do not have public or private funding for the residencies, and aside from the normal house bills and work consumables, we have a full-time person just for production support of the residencies. As such, we have to apply fees, but we do keep the fees to a minimum since we are a not-for-profit association based in a rural area.\nMonthly fees are the following:\n1. São João larger bedroom with private bathroom - 1000€;\n2. São João other two bedrooms - 900€;\n3. Padaria's house - 1000€;\n4. Casa da Avo - 1000€;\n5. Casa Buinho (the whole house for one resident) - 1300€.\nAn accompanying person has a 50% discount but must share the accommodation. It is an additional measure to support couples, artists with children, or possible artistic collaborations.\nThe minimum duration of each residency is two weeks and the maximum is two months.","dropped_value":{"required":true,"amount":1000,"currency":"EUR"},"reason":"evidence-not-substring"}
